      "value": "This eye, harvested from a monster, looks like it's peacefully sleeping but gives you a backup when you can't use your eyes.\n\nWhen the eye is activated, the eyelid pops open, and the eye stares frantically about. You see through the eye with normal vision until the end of your next turn, when the eye withers and flakes away.\n\nActivate (Free Action); Components command; Trigger You become blinded, or an effect otherwise impedes your vision; Requirements You are an expert in Perception."
